description = "[b]RailReaper™[/b]: The RailReaper™ fires a single, devastating slug that obliterates everything in its path — but be warned: charging the weapon immobilizes you completely.  Perfect for the tactical thinker who enjoys calculated devastation... and being a sitting target."
video = ExtResource("2_heh0i")
legal_text = "[center][b][color=#BF616A]THE RAILREAPER™[/color][/b][/center]
[center][i]Charged Weapon Activation, Usage, and Immobilization Consent Agreement (CWUICA) v6.7.3[/i][/center]
------------------
[color=#777777][i]By activating, You consent to voluntary immobilization during charging phases and acknowledge all risks involved.[/i][/color]
------------------
[b]1. DEVICE DESCRIPTION:[/b]  
The RailReaper™ is a high-velocity projectile launcher requiring mandatory charge time prior to discharge.
------------------
[b]2. IMMOBILIZATION AND CHARGE CYCLE:[/b]  
During charging, the User shall remain immobile and vulnerable, acknowledging complete suspension of locomotion capabilities.
------------------
[b]3. DAMAGE AND EFFECTS:[/b]  
The projectile penetrates all obstacles, causing devastating linear damage along its trajectory.
------------------
[b]4. PAYMENT TERMS:[/b]  
Includes:
• Base Price  
• Immobilization Risk Premium  
• Overkill Authorization Fee  
------------------
User assumes full responsibility for timing, positioning, and collateral damage.
------------------
[b]5. DISCLAIMERS:[/b]  
The RailReaper™ does not guarantee kill confirmation or enemy surrender. User remains liable for exposure during charge times.
------------------
[quote][i]Warning: Charging is a commitment. Retreat is not guaranteed.[/i][/quote]
------------------
[center][color=#BF616A][b]RailReaper™: Devastation delivered at your stationary command.[/b][/color][/center]"
